  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEM028N Yemen Joint Response 2020-Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WASH services and hygiene improvements, Reproductive Health programming and multipurpose cash delivery to displaced people and host communities in Al Dhale&#x2019;e governorate and the project is understood to be contributing to results in line with the overall Yemen Joint Response 2020. 
Project activities in the WASH sector have been expanded in response to increased COVID-19 risks in the project locations. Additional WASH activities include COVID-19 prevention and hygiene promotion information and awareness/sensitization, hygiene distributions, water supply with water trucking and longer term solutions and Infection Prevention Control at public locations.</narrative>
  </description>
